<section class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__container">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__card">
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__top">
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__head">
          <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__badge">TL;DR</span>
          <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__title">Google Forms or Microsoft Forms: which should you choose?</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__answer">Pick by the suite you already pay for, because Workspace and Microsoft 365 are priced identically at every comparable tier. Google Forms wins on free use, quiz analytics, and scale ceilings; Microsoft Forms wins on governance, AI assistance, and a BAA that is available by default. Both have shallow branching, which is where Formester comes in.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__list"><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--c" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Free use without a paid suite</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--c">Google Forms</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--c" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20V10"/><path d="M18 20V4"/><path d="M6 20v-4"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Quiz grading and analytics</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--c">Google Forms</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--c" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Governed data inside the tenant</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--c">Microsoft Forms</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--c" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1.5l2 6.9 6.9 2-6.9 2-2 6.9-2-6.9-6.9-2 6.9-2z"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Shipping AI assistance today</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--c">Microsoft Forms</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--f" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Logic beyond forward-only branching</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--f">Formester</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__row"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__ic--f" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg></span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__need">Payments and an MCP server</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pick--f">Formester</span></li></ol>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk">
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-head">
          <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1.5l2 6.9 6.9 2-6.9 2-2 6.9-2-6.9-6.9-2 6.9-2z"/></svg></span>
          <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-title">When should you pick Formester?</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-list"><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-item"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span><span><strong>The form needs real logic.</strong> Branch on any field and jump in any direction. Google branches at section level only, Microsoft branches forward only.</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-item"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span><span><strong>You need to take money.</strong> Stripe and PayPal fields on the free plan. Neither suite ships a payment field at any price.</span></li><li class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-item"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span><span><strong>You want AI drafting without an add-on.</strong> Prompt, question list, or PDF on the free plan. Copilot in Forms needs a licence listed at $21 a user, and Google's is trusted-tester only.</span></li></ul>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-answer__pk-caveat">Stay in the suite when the responses must sit inside your tenant or under a BAA you already hold. Formester is GDPR, UK GDPR, and CCPA compliant, and is not HIPAA certified.</p>
      </div>
