<section class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__container">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__eyebrow">Pricing compared</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__heading">Google Forms vs Microsoft Forms pricing: what do you actually pay?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__sub">Both products are free with a consumer account and bundled into every paid business tier. The suite prices match exactly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__grid fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__grid--three">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card">
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://ssl.gstatic.com/docs/forms/device_home/android_192.png" alt="Google Forms logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Google Forms</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-note">Suite tiers shown, because Forms is bundled into all of them</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Google Forms</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">Free</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Free with any Google account. No documented response cap. Bundled into every paid Workspace tier.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Starter</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$7/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$8.40 a user a month on flexible billing. 30 GB per user, up to 300 users.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Standard</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$14/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$16.80 a user a month on flexible billing. 2 TB per user, up to 300 users.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Plus</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$22/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$26.40 a user a month on flexible billing. 5 TB per user, up to 300 users.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">Contact sales</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">5 TB or more per user and no user limit. Pricing not published.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__foot"><strong>The free tier is genuinely usable.</strong> Google publishes no response cap on a consumer account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card">
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://forms.office.com&amp;size=64" alt="Microsoft Forms logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Microsoft Forms</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-note">Same suite prices, plus a licence for the AI</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Microsoft Forms</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">Free</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Free with a personal account, capped at 200 responses per form and 1,000 on paid. Bundled into every Microsoft 365 Business tier.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Basic</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$7/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$8.40 a user a month billed monthly. Web and mobile apps.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Standard</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$14/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$16.80 a user a month billed monthly. Desktop apps included.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business Premium</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$22/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">$26.40 a user a month billed monthly. Adds advanced security and device management.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Copilot add-on</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$21/user/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">List price billed annually, promoted at $18. Required for Copilot in Forms.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__foot"><strong>Identical suite pricing, plus $21 for the AI.</strong> Free use stops at 200 responses per form.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card--formester">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tag">Our pick</span>
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://formester.com&amp;size=64" alt="Formester logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Formester</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__card-note">Per account, not per user. No suite subscription needed</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Free</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$0/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Unlimited forms, unlimited responses, AI form creator, all field types, quiz auto-scoring, drop-off analysis, payment collection.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Personal</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$13/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Free, plus remove branding, conditional logic and rules, redirect on completion, GTM and GA4, SEO meta tags.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Business</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">$49/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Personal, plus API access, MCP server, PDF exports, 25 team members, real-time collaboration, 50 GB file storage.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-cost">Let's Talk</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Business, plus custom limits, unlimited webhooks, high-volume file uploads, unlimited signatures, priority support.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__foot"><strong>Unlimited responses on every tier.</strong> Real branching and payments start on the free plan, with no per-user maths.</p>
      <a href="https://app.formester.com/users/sign_up" class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__cta">Sign Up Free</a>
    </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__callout">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__callout-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.98.65-1.74 1.41-2.5A4.65 4.65 0 0 0 18 8 6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .23 2.23 1.5 3.5A4.61 4.61 0 0 1 8.91 14"/></svg></span>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-pricing__callout-text"><strong>Worth flagging:</strong> the suites are priced identically, tier for tier, on both cadences: $7 and $8.40, $14 and $16.80, $22 and $26.40. Anything claiming one of these two is the cheaper option is comparing different cadences. The only real cost difference is Microsoft's Copilot licence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
