<section class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__eyebrow">Why teams switch</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__heading">Where does Formester fit between them?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__sub">Four things neither suite's form tool does, at any price.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__grid">
<article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__title">Branching that goes both ways</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__body">Branch on any field, jump in any direction, and route notifications by answer. Both suites branch forward only.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__title">Payments in the form</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__body">Stripe and PayPal fields on the free plan. Neither Google Forms nor Microsoft Forms has a payment field.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1.5l2 6.9 6.9 2-6.9 2-2 6.9-2-6.9-6.9-2 6.9-2z"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__title">AI generation without a licence add-on</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__body">Prompt, question list, or PDF, on the free plan. Google's is a trusted-tester experiment and Microsoft's needs a Copilot licence.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/><line x1="13" y1="4" x2="11" y2="20"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__title">An MCP server for AI agents</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-why-pick__body">Connect Claude, ChatGPT, or your own agents to submissions on the Business plan. Neither suite ships one.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
