<section class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp-title"><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__container"><header class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__header"><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__eyebrow">For developers</span></p><h2 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__title" id="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp-title">Can AI agents read your form data?</h2><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__intro">Neither Google Forms nor Microsoft Forms ships an MCP server, so agent access means going through Apps Script, Graph, or a third-party connector. Formester ships both a REST API and an MCP server on the $49 Business plan.</p></header><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__grid"><article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/><line x1="13" y1="4" x2="11" y2="20"/></svg></span><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__badge">MCP server</span></p><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__card-title">Let Claude, ChatGPT, or your own agents read submissions</h3><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chips"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">Claude</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">ChatGPT</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">Custom agents</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__body">Point any MCP-compatible model at your Formester account and ask questions of the data directly, without exporting to a spreadsheet first. Neither Google Forms nor Microsoft Forms advertises an equivalent.</p><p><a class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.formester.com/formester-mcp-server.html">Read the MCP docs &rarr;</a></p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7V4a3 3 0 016 0v3"/><path d="M7 7h10l-1 7a4 4 0 01-8 0L7 7z"/><path d="M12 18v3.5"/></svg></span><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__badge fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__badge--alt">REST API v2</span></p><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__card-title">Or build on the REST API with a self-service token</h3><div class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chips"><span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">Self-service token</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">Webhooks</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__chip">Business plan +</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__body">Pull submissions into your warehouse, prefill forms from your CRM, or wire webhooks for created, updated, and deleted events. The token comes from app.formester.com/api in two clicks.</p><p><a class="fmstr-cmp-gvm-api-mcp__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.formester.com/formester-api.html">Read the API docs &rarr;</a></p></article></div></div></section>
      </div>
    </section>

